window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-99d1e8fe39794227"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"build-a-dashboard-that-stays-up-to-date\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">构建持续更新的数据仪表盘</h1> <p>将数据转换为私密仪表盘，并让它保持更新。</p> <p>请 ChatGPT Work 将电子表格转换为私密、可交互的 Site， 按计划检查源数据，并指出需要你关注的变化。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>根据电子表格或销售导出数据构建可交互的仪表盘。</li> <li>无需手动检查源数据，也能让仪表盘保持最新。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>sites</code></td> <td>构建并预览私密、可交互的仪表盘。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive（需联网）</a></td> <td>读取经批准用于仪表盘的电子表格和来源文件。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>检查源数据、计算变化，并验证仪表盘。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>构建持续更新的数据仪表盘</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">使用 @Sites 和 @google-drive，将我最新的销售数据转换为私密、可交互的仪表盘。 使用我附上的电子表格或 CSV，或我粘贴到本次聊天中的确切 Google Drive 或 Google Sheets URL。如果我既没有附上文件，也没有提供来源 URL，请向我要一份， 不要猜测。\n\n展示收入、客户细分、随时间的变化，以及任何异常情况。提供清晰的图表、日期和 客户细分筛选器、来源最后更新时间，以及结果背后的计算方法。检查缺失行、 无法匹配的记录和不一致的日期，并说明任何可能影响结论的情况。\n\n每个工作日早晨检查经批准的来源。数据发生变化时更新仪表盘；只有在出现重要 变化、数据质量问题或需要我检查的事项时才通知我。如果没有重要变化，不要发送更新。\n\n展示仪表盘，供我检查。保持它的私密性；未经我批准，不要发布、分享、修改它的 访问权限，或联系任何人。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">Sites 文档</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">定时任务</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾加上 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"before-you-start\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">开始前</h2> <p>附上一份 CSV 或电子表格，或者连接 Google Drive，并把确切的 Google Drive 或 Google Sheets URL 粘贴到聊天中。Sites 可以将这些来源转换为私密、可交互的仪表盘，无需发布仪表盘或公开你的数据。</p> <p>你可以在浏览器或桌面应用中的 ChatGPT Work 里构建仪表盘。如果希望定时检查在笔记本关机后仍能继续，请在浏览器中启动任务。基于桌面的任务需要你的计算机保持开机，并且桌面应用持续运行。</p> <p><a id=\"what-to-expect\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">预期效果</h2> <p>ChatGPT 会检查源数据、创建仪表盘，并展示图表背后的数值。本示例使用虚构的季度销售导出数据、一份客户细分映射表，以及一张有代表性的仪表盘预览。它会区分金额变化最大和百分比变化最大的项目，并标记出无法匹配到客户细分的订单。</p> <p><a id=\"example-dashboard\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_8\">仪表盘示例</h3> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>客户细分</th> <th>Q1 收入</th> <th>Q2 收入</th> <th>变化</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>企业客户</td> <td>$3,000</td> <td>$2,450</td> <td>-$550 (-18.3%)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>中型企业客户</td> <td>$1,000</td> <td>$1,170</td> <td>+$170 (+17%)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>中小企业（SMB）</td> <td>$400</td> <td>$520</td> <td>+$120 (+30%)</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>企业客户的金额变化最大，中小企业的百分比变化最大。有一笔价值 $160 的 Q2 订单无法与客户细分映射表匹配，因此未计入各客户细分的总额。这个私密仪表盘包含对比图、客户细分和日期筛选器、来源数据的新鲜度，以及底层计算过程。</p> <p>当你要求每个工作日早晨检查来源时，ChatGPT 会在经批准的数据发生变化后更新仪表盘，并指出重大变化或缺失记录。未经批准，它不会发布或分享仪表盘。</p> <p><a id=\"how-it-works\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_9\">运作方式</h2> <ul> <li><strong>连接来源：</strong>附上销售导出数据或电子表格，或粘贴经批准使用的 Google Sheet 或 Google Drive 文件的确切链接。ChatGPT 会先检查列、日期和客户记录，再得出结论。</li> <li><strong>构建仪表盘：</strong>Sites 会将结果转换为私密、可交互的仪表盘，其中包含图表、筛选器、来源数据的新鲜度和支持结果的计算过程。</li> <li><strong>保持更新：</strong>定时运行的 ChatGPT Work 任务会在每个工作日检查经批准的来源，并在数据发生变化时更新仪表盘。网站本身并不负责运行这个定时计划。</li> <li><strong>只提示重要事项：</strong>请 ChatGPT 指出异常变化、缺失记录或需要检查的决策。如果没有重要变化，它应保持安静。</li> <li><strong>分享前先检查：</strong>先查看仪表盘。只有在你批准访问权限变更后，才让 ChatGPT 将其分享给指定人员。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"share-the-dashboard\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_10\">分享仪表盘</h2> <p>检查仪表盘后，可以请 ChatGPT 将它分享给指定人员，或使你的工作区可以访问它。你也可以直接在 <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/sites\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sites（需联网）</a> 中管理访问权限。在邀请任何人、发布仪表盘或修改可见范围之前，请 ChatGPT 展示当前分享设置，并等待你的批准。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Share this dashboard with [name or email]. Show me the current access settings, who will be able to view it, and the dashboard link first. Wait for my approval before changing access or sending an invitation.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">请将这个仪表板分享给 [name or email]。先向我展示当前访问设置、哪些人将能够查看，以及仪表板链接。等我批准后，再更改访问权限或发送邀请。</div></div> <p>有关分享选项和工作区访问权限，请参阅 <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/sites\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sites 文档（本地尚未收录）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"take-it-further\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_11\">进一步使用</h2> <p><strong>更改仪表盘跟踪的内容</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Update this dashboard to show revenue by customer segment and region. Include the change from the previous period, the source freshness, a filter for each region, and any records that could not be matched. Keep the dashboard private.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">请更新这个仪表板，按客户细分群体和地区展示收入。包括与上一期间相比的变化、来源数据的更新时间、每个地区的筛选器，以及无法匹配的记录。保持仪表板为私有。</div></div> <p><strong>设置更有用的提醒</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">When you refresh the dashboard, notify me only if a customer segment changes by more than 15%, a source has stopped updating, or records cannot be matched. Show the change, link it to the source, and tell me what needs review. Do not message me if nothing meets those conditions.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">刷新仪表板时，只有在某个客户细分群体的变化超过 15%、某个来源停止更新，或记录无法匹配时，才通知我。展示变化，附上对应来源，并告诉我哪些内容需要审阅。如果没有任何事项符合这些条件，就不要给我发消息。</div></div> <p><strong>准备每周更新</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Every Friday, prepare a short update using the latest dashboard. Include what changed, the most useful chart, any data-quality caveats, and the decisions that need attention. Save it for my review without sending it to anyone.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">每周五，使用最新的仪表板准备一份简短更新。包括发生了哪些变化、最有用的图表、数据质量方面的注意事项，以及需要关注的决策。将其保存供我审阅，不要发送给任何人。</div></div>","en":"<h1 id=\"build-a-dashboard-that-stays-up-to-date\">Build a dashboard that stays up to date</h1> <p>Turn your data into a private dashboard and keep it up to date.</p> <p>Ask ChatGPT Work to turn your spreadsheets into a private, interactive Site, check the source data on a schedule, and flag the changes that need your attention.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Building an interactive dashboard from spreadsheets or sales exports.</li> <li>Keeping the dashboard current without manually checking the source data.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>sites</code></td> <td>Build and preview a private, interactive dashboard.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive (online)</a></td> <td>Read the approved spreadsheets and source files behind the dashboard.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Check source data, calculate changes, and verify the dashboard.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Build a dashboard that stays up to date</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use @Sites and @google-drive to turn my latest sales data into a private, interactive dashboard. Use the spreadsheets or CSVs I attach, or the exact Google Drive or Google Sheets URL I paste into this chat. If I have not attached a file or provided a source URL, ask me for one instead of guessing.\n\nShow revenue, customer segments, changes over time, and anything unusual. Include clear charts, date and segment filters, when the source was last updated, and the calculations behind the results. Check for missing rows, unmatched records, and inconsistent dates, and explain anything that could change the answer.\n\nCheck the approved source every weekday morning. Update the dashboard when the data changes, and notify me only when there is a meaningful change, a data-quality problem, or something I need to review. If nothing important has changed, do not send an update.\n\nShow me the dashboard for review. Keep it private, and do not publish it, share it, change its permissions, or contact anyone without my approval.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">Sites documentation</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">Scheduled tasks</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">Plugins</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"before-you-start\">Before you start</h2> <p>Attach a CSV or spreadsheet, or connect Google Drive and paste the exact Google Drive or Google Sheets URL into the chat. Sites can turn those sources into a private, interactive dashboard without publishing it or making your data public.</p> <p>You can build the dashboard in ChatGPT Work in the browser or desktop app. For a scheduled check that continues when your laptop is off, start the task in the browser. A desktop-based task requires your computer to be on and the desktop app to be running.</p> <h2 id=\"what-to-expect\">What to expect</h2> <p>ChatGPT checks the source data, creates a dashboard, and shows the numbers behind the charts. This example uses fictional quarterly sales exports, a customer-segment map, and a representative dashboard preview. It distinguishes the largest dollar change from the largest percentage change and flags an order that cannot be matched to a customer segment.</p> <h3 id=\"example-dashboard\">Example dashboard</h3> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Customer segment</th> <th>Q1 revenue</th> <th>Q2 revenue</th> <th>Change</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>Enterprise</td> <td>$3,000</td> <td>$2,450</td> <td>-$550 (-18.3%)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Mid-market</td> <td>$1,000</td> <td>$1,170</td> <td>+$170 (+17%)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>SMB</td> <td>$400</td> <td>$520</td> <td>+$120 (+30%)</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>Enterprise had the largest dollar change, and SMB had the largest percentage change. One Q2 order worth $160 did not match the customer-segment map and was excluded from the segment totals. The private dashboard includes a comparison chart, segment and date filters, source freshness, and the underlying calculations.</p> <p>When asked to check the source every weekday morning, ChatGPT updates the dashboard when the approved data changes and flags material changes or missing records. It does not publish or share the dashboard without approval.</p> <h2 id=\"how-it-works\">How it works</h2> <ul> <li><strong>Connect the source:</strong> attach a sales export or spreadsheet, or paste the exact link to an approved Google Sheet or Google Drive file. ChatGPT checks the columns, dates, and customer records before drawing conclusions.</li> <li><strong>Build the dashboard:</strong> Sites turns the results into a private, interactive dashboard with charts, filters, source freshness, and supporting calculations.</li> <li><strong>Keep it current:</strong> a scheduled ChatGPT Work task checks the approved source each weekday and updates the dashboard when the data changes. The site does not run the schedule itself.</li> <li><strong>Only surface what matters:</strong> ask ChatGPT to flag unusual changes, missing records, or decisions that need review. If nothing important changes, it should stay quiet.</li> <li><strong>Review before sharing:</strong> inspect the dashboard first. Ask ChatGPT to share it with specific people only after you approve the access change.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"share-the-dashboard\">Share the dashboard</h2> <p>After reviewing the dashboard, ask ChatGPT to share it with specific people or make it available to your workspace. You can also manage access directly in <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/sites\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sites (online)</a>. Ask ChatGPT to show the current sharing settings and wait for your approval before inviting anyone, publishing the dashboard, or changing its visibility.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Share this dashboard with [name or email]. Show me the current access settings, who will be able to view it, and the dashboard link first. Wait for my approval before changing access or sending an invitation.\n</code></pre> <p>See the <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/sites\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sites documentation (not in this local snapshot)</a> for sharing options and workspace access.</p> <h2 id=\"take-it-further\">Take it further</h2> <p><strong>Change what the dashboard tracks</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Update this dashboard to show revenue by customer segment and region. Include the change from the previous period, the source freshness, a filter for each region, and any records that could not be matched. Keep the dashboard private.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Set a more useful alert</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">When you refresh the dashboard, notify me only if a customer segment changes by more than 15%, a source has stopped updating, or records cannot be matched. Show the change, link it to the source, and tell me what needs review. Do not message me if nothing meets those conditions.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Prepare a weekly update</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Every Friday, prepare a short update using the latest dashboard. Include what changed, the most useful chart, any data-quality caveats, and the decisions that need attention. Save it for my review without sending it to anyone.\n</code></pre>"};
